        "text": "Synthetic policy 7 / 合成政策",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 0
        },
        "style": "Title"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_c837aae4fbf25bc3612eb531",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "供应商准入的提交期限为8个工作日。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 1
        },
        "style": "Heading 2"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_ab1a05f8f47830471fb5c569",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "供应商准入的审批责任人为采购。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 2
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_6f94a27328112d78565dfc6c",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "供应商准入必须提供安全问卷。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 3
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_64cfd876e5434fe4e5e94fed",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "供应商准入记录须保留15个月。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 4
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_186f2448feae503c63dcb9b2",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "供应商准入的紧急例外需要部门负责人书面批准。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 5
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
      {
        "id": "blk_8e268389d270ca798ce3c5c1",
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "text": "供应商准入必须通过供应商平台提交。",
        "anchor": {
          "kind": "document_block",
          "block_index": 6
        },
        "style": "Normal"
      },
